]},{"date":"2021-11-03T01:20:01-07:00","id":1466424,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Martian1912</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1466234-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-rpg-books?p=1466422#post1466422\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well I'm hoping Amazon will get the rest of Vampire the Masquerade 5th RPG books then what they have currently?,<br /> <br /> LW</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Could be worse, you could live in Australia like me and pay $50 postage per book. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-03T04:36:57-07:00","id":1466440,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Martian1912</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1466234-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-rpg-books?p=1466422#post1466422\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well I'm hoping Amazon will get the rest of Vampire the Masquerade 5th RPG books then what they have currently?,<br /> <br /> LW</div> </div> </div> </div>Drivethru is their main distributor, despite how much they like to work with Amazon. As a rule of thumb it is best to learn to work with them than count only on Amazon for most RPG publishers.<br /> <br /> They also sell in the registered PDF format, which is way cheaper, and are the keepers of the Storyteller Vault.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1466234-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-rpg-books?p=1466424#post1466424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could be worse, you could live in Australia like me and pay $50 postage per book. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Currently I pay more than 5 BRL for each dollar thanks to the awesome work of the Brazillian president and his Minister for Economy, and postage here isn't cheap either (being also in dollar, so it also increases five times).<br /> <br /> Our connected world have so many ways to screw things up for people living outside the US bubble of reality...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-04T16:57:03-07:00","id":1466725,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Martian1912</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1466234-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-rpg-books#post1466234\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi I'm having trouble getting a complete RPG collection of Vampire the Masquerade 5th books, Amazon no matter which version I use only have a few I need complete collection.<br /> <br /> LW</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The issue you're running into is, not all of the V5 books got actual print runs in stores, so Amazon and other retailers will only have those that did, which is going to be the Core, Cam, Anarch, ST Screen, Sabbat (when it lands), Fall of London and Book of Nod. You'll also see Chicago and I think Cults because those Kickstarters had backer tiers that stores could get bulk copies of.<br /> <br /> The other V5 books (which are expansion books from the Kickstarters for Chicago and Cults of the Blood Gods) did not get print runs from the Kickstarters, they were PDF only and are available as Print on Demand on DriveThruRPG. Those are Chicago Folios, Let the Streets Run Red, Children of the Blood, Trails of Ash and Bone and the upcoming Forbidden Religions book.<br /> <br /> The latter bunch you'd have to order off of DTRPG as Print on Demand if you wanted physicals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-04T18:31:21-07:00","id":1466734,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>elmerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1466234-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-rpg-books?p=1466725#post1466725\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The latter bunch you'd have to order off of DTRPG as Print on Demand if you wanted physicals.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or buy the PDF and order printing and binding service from a third party, this is still perfectly legal and may cost less depending on your local options for the service.<br /> <br /> In that case, though, I'd recommend to pay attention to the quality of the bindings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-06T01:52:00-07:00","id":1466916,"title":"","content":"Well since I played PS4 Vampire the Masquerade 5th games it god me interested in the game and setting again, I need a new New York by Night source book, I need real RPG books and print on demand from drivethru RPG web page.<br /> <br /> If I want to offically create vampire character for WOD then I need all official RPG I can get my hands on.<br /> <br /> LW","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3380-martian1912","name":"Martian1912","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-06T07:01:48-07:00","id":1466935,"title":"","content":"Well you only really need seven books, the Rulebook, V5 Anarchs for the Setites/Ministry, V5 Camarilla for the Assamites/Banu Haqim, V5 Chicago by Night for the Lasombra, Cults of the Blood Gods for the Giovanni/Hecata and the V5 Companion for the Ravnos, Tzimisce and Salubri. The V5 Companion is the only one that doesn't have a print-on demand option because Paradox released as a free PDF on the World of Darkness site rather than thru DriveThruRPG and even though it came out nearly a year ago, haven't bothered to move it over to DriveThruRPG.<br /> <br /> And yes, it is annoying that we need <b><i>seven </i></b>books to play and use the 13 Core Clans.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-06T07:23:32-07:00","id":1466942,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AkatsukiLeader13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1466234-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-rpg-books?p=1466935#post1466935\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well you only really need seven books, the Rulebook, V5 Anarchs for the Setites/Ministry, V5 Camarilla for the Assamites/Banu Haqim, V5 Chicago by Night for the Lasombra, Cults of the Blood Gods for the Giovanni/Hecata and the V5 Companion for the Ravnos, Tzimisce and Salubri. The V5 Companion is the only one that doesn't have a print-on demand option because Paradox released as a free PDF on the World of Darkness site rather than thru DriveThruRPG and even though it came out nearly a year ago, haven't bothered to move it over to DriveThruRPG.<br /> <br /> And yes, it is annoying that we need <b><i>seven </i></b>books to play and use the 13 Core Clans.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is what (among other things) irked me so much about V5. Revised and V20 did a great job of putting all the main clans into one book. And then comes Paradox and tries and fails to discover wheel again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2357-sathriel","name":"sathriel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-06T10:23:28-07:00","id":1466960,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Martian1912</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1466234-vampire-the-masquerade-5th-rpg-books?p=1466916#post1466916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I want to offically create vampire character for WOD then I need all official RPG I can get my hands on.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't see the point.<br /> <br /> Unless you look at the STV, the PDFs in Drivethru are official books. They don't get less official if you buy then and print yourself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","